* SKY130 porting DRAFT: topology and W/L/m preserved; NOT qualified.
* MOS W/L below are micrometres; use .option scale=1e-6 in testbench.
* m is explicit parallel multiplicity; nf=1. No sizing optimization.
.subckt folded_cascode_ota vinp vinn vout ibias vdd vss
XMMNbias ibias ibias vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 w=3.3 l=1 m=1 nf=1
XMMPfold_bias vbias_fold vbias_fold vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 w=5 l=2 m=4 nf=1
XMMNfold_bias vbias_fold ibias vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 w=3.3 l=1 m=1 nf=1
